\pard\plain \fi720\sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Stern and measured, her voice carried none of the motherly lilt heard in his dreams.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93This is the Lady Pel. I should mention that she is a potential patroness, Mandri, so be on your best behavior.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Pleased to meet you,\u8221\'94 Pel said. She held out her arm, exposing her wrist and a thin silver bracelet choked the softest flesh. Hand out, fingers down, her bejeweled ring glistened. There was a clear of expectation that it should be kissed. \u8220\'93Vigram\u8217\'92s told me everything about you.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I doubt it,\u8221\'94 Mandri said. He took her hand and shook it. \u8220\'93For one thing, I don\u8217\'92t paint anymore, so if you\u8217\'92re wanting me to rough up some backwater temple icon, you\u8217\'92ll have to find someone else.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93}{\f1\fs24\b0\i1 Back}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0 water?\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8221\'94 Pel scoffed. She turned to Vigram. \u8220\'93Does he always express himself so cheaply?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Vigram shrugged. \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93It is as I said, the boy has no filter.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Oh, really?\u8221\'94 Pel said flatly. \u8220\'93I have always thought that such untoward meanness does not come naturally. The belittler is a mask that hides a black pit of shame. Does that describe you, Mandri? Please be honest: was your insult an attempt to distract me from seeing how empty you are inside?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 She knew nothing about him. That is the way with a certain breed of wealthy. He said, \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I feel compelled to insult you again.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Pel smirked. \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93You are fitting the mold,\u8221\'94 she said . \u8220\'93That is good.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93A mold for what? You want me to paint something?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93No, I want you to be you, simply you, as all artists are wont to do. I will observe. Pretend that I am not here.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93And what are you observing, exactly? Vigram is the one who is painting.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Pel\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s smirk spread into a sardonic grin. \u8220\'93I learn so much about person by watching them teach. Especially if the student is difficult.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I am the }{\f1\fs24\b0\i1 ideal}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0  student,\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8221\'94 Vigram asserted. Then he said aside to Mandri, \u8220\'93Aren\u8217\'92t I?\u8221\'94 }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Mandri nodded. \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Undoubtedly.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 OX--}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Mandri offers to buy Vigram\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s ox.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Mandri overwhelmed by the ox\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s will to live. Inspiring stuff.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I will buy that ox.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93What?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I will buy that ox, just to get you to relax.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Nonesense.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I\u8217\'92m serious. Let it go.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93But you\u8217\'92re only here for the money, and you want to spend it on that decrepit ox?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93A relaxing day is worth the spend.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93But it would halve your wage. You lead a meager existence as it is, I don\u8217\'92t think you can afford it.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I\u8217\'92ll be fine.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93You\u8217\'92re serious?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Vigram struggle between the prospect of easy money, and the domination of the ox.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Very well. Might as well pay you before I forget.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 He \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Half your pay. As for the ox, I will have to tear the leeches from it first.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93No, hold on, Vigram\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 \u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Moaning.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Uncomfortable?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93This isn\u8217\'92t exactly paradise.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93No, it is not.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93That was a very compassionate act.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Was it?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93You are poor. From how Vigram tells it, you are barely alive. To give up your pay for an ox that is already nearly dead\u8230\'85Was that an act of genuine concern, or do you care so little about yourself that the ox might as well live for a little while in your stead?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I just want some peace and quiet, that\u8217\'92s all.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Return here tomorrow morning. I have a job for you. You would make back what you\u8217\'92ve just paid Vigram several times over. If you do a good job, you\u8217\'92ll never have to worry about money again.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Sorry, I have plans tomorrow morning.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93No you don\u8217\'92t.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Aren\u8217\'92t you forgetting something?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93What?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Your ox!\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Uh, tell Vigram to let it go free, or something.\u8221\'94}
